message: "If you use this code, its run outputs or its results, please cite the article (preferred-citation) and this repository."
type: software
title: "cf-stability: string stability of learned car-following models"
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations, run manifests and results of the study "String Stability of Learned Car-Following Models:
  Audit, Differentiable Penalties, a Certified Hybrid and Corridor-Level Validation": an audit of the equilibrium
  (string) stability of learned car-following models, differentiable stability penalties, a residual hybrid with an a
  priori certificate, and the validation of the laws on SUMO corridors of NGSIM I-80 and US-101.
